263
00:23:28.530 --> 00:23:36.090
Mu kallikene, ma kohe tulen
ja pista sulle midagi suu niimoodi.

264
00:23:36.450 --> 00:23:38.775
Nii niimoodi.

265
00:23:50.500 --> 00:23:54.720
Vanaema suvine, mina,
mina suren hirmust.

266
00:23:54.820 --> 00:23:57.180
Kivi kuju elab

267
00:23:57.280 --> 00:24:00.670
